   - Add an explanatory note with the submission and attach proof of the name change.
4. If you want, I can draft a short email or script you can use to ask the organization whether they require an exact match and what documentation they accept.

If you tell me who the form is for (employer, bank, government agency), I can give more specific guidance or draft a short inquiry for you.

