- If you already submitted a form and it was rejected for a mismatch, contact the organization’s support or HR, explain the mismatch, and provide the requested proof so they can correct/ reprocess.

Practical filling tips
- Use your full legal first name, middle name or initial exactly as on SSA card (not nicknames), last name and any suffix.
- Don’t add extra punctuation or diacritics that aren’t on the official record.
- If a form has a separate field for “former name” or “also known as,” fill that in if applicable.

