- If you tell me what the form is for (employer W‑2/payroll, bank account, government benefit, loan, DMV, etc.) and how the name differs (typo, missing middle name, maiden vs married name, hyphenation), I’ll give specific next steps and, if you want, draft a short message you can send to the organization asking how to proceed.

